pub const fn carrying_carryless_mul(self, rhs: u64, carry: u64) -> (u64, u64)

🔬This is a nightly-only experimental API. (uint_carryless_mul #152080)

Calculates the “full carryless multiplication” without the possibility to overflow.

This returns the low-order (wrapping) bits and the high-order (overflow) bits of the result as two separate values, in that order.

